<meta name="description" content="MVP Enables High Quality Health ResearchThe Million Veteran Program (MVP) is the nation’s largest biorepository of Veteran data and has one of the world’s most diverse cohorts of any genetic research program. Thanks to our partnership with hundreds of researchers and their collaboration together, MVP data has already led to new findings about conditions such as anxiety, post-traumatic stress disorder (PTSD), heart disease, kidney disease, cancer and more." />
